                    {
                        "sense_id": "9b2bfd81-fbcc-374b-802a-459363ee02ca",
                        "entry_id": "b0feaa32-675a-3f40-9f9d-ace82a24e380",
                        "glosses": [
                            "科索沃（位於東南歐的國家）；塞爾維亞政府只承認該地區為塞爾維亞的兩個自治省之一"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f279c3ad-4fdf-49d5-be3d-a49280237174",
                                "sense_id": "9b2bfd81-fbcc-374b-802a-459363ee02ca",
                                "text": "Yugoslavia’s President, Slobodan Milosevic, has rejected all efforts at meaningful diplomacy and, in violation of his own previous commitments, has ratcheted up his military campaign against the innocent civilians of Kosovo."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4fe2cebe-bb31-4827-b9e6-b5a9b3ec208e",
                                "sense_id": "9b2bfd81-fbcc-374b-802a-459363ee02ca",
                                "text": "After Milosevic’s overthrow in October 2000, international pressure on the new authorities in Belgrade to extradict Milosevic for alleged war crimes committed during the Kosovo conflict was intense."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "733bff27-3d56-478f-a24f-156c3ff80b06",
                                "sense_id": "9b2bfd81-fbcc-374b-802a-459363ee02ca",
                                "text": "A prominent Kosovo Serb politician, Oliver Ivanovic, was shot dead outside his party offices Tuesday morning, halting talks between Kosovar and Serb delegates that had been set to resume that day."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8e7d3b82-8f9a-3afd-9a13-63c6f1a942dd",
                        "entry_id": "b0feaa32-675a-3f40-9f9d-ace82a24e380",
                        "glosses": [
                            "塞爾維亞政府立場中上述地區內的五個行政區（科索沃區、科索沃波莫拉夫列區、科索沃米特羅維察區、佩奇區／貝赤區、普里茲倫區）之一"
                        ],
